6782:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32h7xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
6783:Drivers/STM32H7xx_HAL_Driver/Inc/stm32h7xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Put ADC instance in deep power down state.
